gineering</span>\n                  \n                \n              </div>\n            \n\n            <small class=\"challenge-attribution text-center text-muted\">\n              \n            </small>\n\n            \n\n            <span class=\"challenge-desc\"><p>When &quot;The Severance&quot; hit in 2100, the Kuiper Relay wasn't abandoned. Instead, it was locked into a loop governed by the Council. To prevent manual takeover, the council's instruction consumes and rewrites its own memory.</p>\n<p>To force an administrative override, your payload must achieve harmonic resonance across the three rings of the Astrolabe:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Unravel the permutation field of the first gate.</li>\n<li>Stabilize the coupled wave recurrence across the lattice.</li>\n<li>Lock onto the projective coordinates of the orbital horizon.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The telemetry receiver requires exact synchronization with the beacon and will purge the core if total execution falls outside the quantum decay window.</p>\n<p>Flag Format: CSSCTF{...}</p>\n</span>\n\n            \n              <div class=\"mb-2\">\n                <span class=\"challenge-connection-info\">\n                  \n                    \n                    \n                      <code>nc 34.116.80.78 7654</code>\n                    \n                  \n                </span>\n              </div>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \n              <div class=\"row challenge-files text-center pb-3\">\n                \n                  <div class=\"col-md-4 col-sm-4 col-xs-12 file-button-wrapper d-block\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                      \n                    \n                    <a\n                        class=\"btn btn-info btn-file mb-1 d-inline-block px-2 w-100 text-truncate\"\n                        href=\"/files/861c8dac4e545b7a0bf8e7e5e025ccac/ouroboros.7z?token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjoxNTE0LCJ0ZWFtX2lkIjo5MDEsImZpbGVfaWQiOjMyfQ.ar4JCw.RUj9rWQQ